{'symbol': 'LRCX', 'date': '2022-09-15 02:00:00', 'title': 'LAM RESEARCH OPENS NEW STATE-OF-THE-ART CENTER FOR ENGINEERING IN BENGALURU, INDIA', 'text': "NEW, CUTTING-EDGE FACILITY WILL LEVERAGE THE COUNTRY'S ENGINEERING TALENT POOL TO ACCELERATE LAM'S RESEARCH AND DEVELOPMENT OF SEMICONDUCTOR MANUFACTURING EQUIPMENT & RELATED TECHNOLOGIES\xa0 BENGALURU, INDIA , SEPT. 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LAM RESEARCH CORP. (NASDAQ: LRCX) TODAY CELEBRATED THE OPENING OF THE COMPANY'S NEW INDIA CENTER FOR ENGINEERING IN BENGALURU, THE COMPANY'S MOST ADVANCED FACILITY IN THE COUNTRY TO DATE."}